{"id":"444f0ea79c63c8b6f6a958ae7d30f03bc2d60de3","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1258022","title":"用完 gpt-6.2 当场退订转 gemini","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"zengxs","excerpt":"程序员 - @zengxs - 6.2-astra 给我的感觉就是拉了坨大的完全不说人话了直接退订了 gpt 200 刀，转了 gemini 100 刀刚用上 agy，还在熟悉中，好像还能用 claude，就是不","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>6.2-astra 给我的感觉就是拉了坨大的<br>完全不说人话了</p><p>直接退订了 gpt 200 刀，转了 gemini 100 刀</p><p>刚用上 agy，还在熟悉中，好像还能用 claude，就是不知道额度有多少</p></div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n<div id=\"topic-replies\">\n    \n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18303638\" data-reply-id=\"18303638\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9921/b66e/626951_normal.png?m=1782749574\" alt=\"1874w\" data-uid=\"626951\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>1</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>可以可以，都走吧，这样我的 GPT 能快点，最近确实太慢了</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18303666\" data-reply-id=\"18303666\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/e15c58f49cf3976f2a8ee25a63b2c232?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"wooleo\" data-uid=\"72187\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>2</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>里面的 claude 额度极少</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18303677\" data-reply-id=\"18303677\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/aacc/d2f0/487121_normal.png?m=1786356074\" alt=\"zengxs\" data-uid=\"487121\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>3</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>@<a href=\"/member/1874w\">1874w</a>  哈哈 我每个月用的 token 很少，走了也释放不了多少算力</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18303729\" data-reply-id=\"18303729\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/edca324d47716a2926b39c2c75184adb?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"526457385\" data-uid=\"648590\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>6</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>写个 crud 闹麻了，转来转去麻烦，就用 codex 养老了，毕竟 reset 大法好</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18303731\" data-reply-id=\"18303731\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/0c1018bbed9adeb1177fe8ce0a41d9f3?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"BestEicky\" data-uid=\"449657\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>7</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>实际下来，你还是会回到 GPT 的，因为哈基米干活时真慢，比 GPT 还慢</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18303743\" data-reply-id=\"18303743\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/aacc/d2f0/487121_normal.png?m=1786356074\" alt=\"zengxs\" data-uid=\"487121\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>8</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>@<a href=\"/member/uncleroot\">uncleroot</a> 在跑第一个任务，还在对齐需求，没实际开始编码</p><p>对齐需求这一步，哈基米至少会说人话，明显比 gpt-6.2-astra 强的多，<br>对比 gpt-6-astra 体感上暂时感觉差不多，可能 哈基米略强，还需要再体验一段时间看看</p></div>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18303774\" data-reply-id=\"18303774\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/aacc/d2f0/487121_normal.png?m=1786356074\" alt=\"zengxs\" data-uid=\"487121\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>10</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>@<a href=\"/member/526457385\">526457385</a> 换个 agent 也不算麻烦吧，agy 我 10 分钟就配好了，加上订阅也就 15 分钟左右</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18303788\" data-reply-id=\"18303788\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/5d51756303e9a5222f04f031f6a135d4?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"momowei\" data-uid=\"80631\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>11</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>你们都写得啥操作系统嘛，我做后端得，我觉得 gpt 最近几个版本用着还行，尤其是 sol，性价比很高</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18303796\" data-reply-id=\"18303796\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4285/1276/42390_normal.png?m=1773662508\" alt=\"kamisamayo\" data-uid=\"42390\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>12</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>我最近几天高强度用 gemini，昨天用完一周量提示我 3 天后重置，今天起来一看都全满了相当于重置了（是 feature 还是 bug 还是反重力也搞重置）。<br>我感觉如果是需求明确，让 gemini 干活还行，但是他一直有那种，懒得思考的习惯。就是自己快速做完很自信告诉你怎样怎样，实际做的不靠谱。<br>我让 Claude 后续接手 gemini 期间写的东西，一查全是架构问题，codex 给我 code review，也说 gemini 很多地方错误。<br>如果你需求明确，对代码很熟悉，那我觉得 gemini 可以。喜欢赛博许愿式编程的就不太行。</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18303810\" data-reply-id=\"18303810\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/ffca59c5ffc890b3fd7065b5f93bf4ae?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"deplives\" data-uid=\"456093\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>13</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>我司很多人在 carbon 发布第一天就各种订阅甚至还有好多家庭组，然后这几天天天吐槽，今天又都回到了 oai 的怀抱哈哈哈</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18303848\" data-reply-id=\"18303848\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/aacc/d2f0/487121_normal.png?m=1786356074\" alt=\"zengxs\" data-uid=\"487121\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>14</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>@<a href=\"/member/momowei\">momowei</a> 做平台网关，偏 infra 吧，不是操作系统</p><p>主要问题不是模型智力，而是他不说人话，沟通需求很费劲<br>智力稍差点其实不太有关系，因为我基本上还是会自己人工 review 代码的</p></div>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18303878\" data-reply-id=\"18303878\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/aacc/d2f0/487121_normal.png?m=1786356074\" alt=\"zengxs\" data-uid=\"487121\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>15</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>@<a href=\"/member/kamisamayo\">kamisamayo</a> 这种 review 有可能和模型有关系，模型自己写的代码自己不一定能 review 出来问题，可能得用一些不同模型交叉 review</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18304020\" data-reply-id=\"18304020\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/aacc/d2f0/487121_normal.png?m=1786356074\" alt=\"zengxs\" data-uid=\"487121\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>17</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>@<a href=\"/member/deplives\">deplives</a> 各种模型都试试，这挺好的，也能避免模型供应商一家独大，然后搞垄断</p><p>不同工作对模型要求不同，目前应该没有一个适合所有场景的模型，试了实在不合适大不了再换回去</p></div>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n  